applies whether the Code Contribution or Documentation Contribution is later
accepted, rejected, closed, withdrawn, removed, or not incorporated into
Intergrax. Submission of a Code Contribution or Documentation Contribution does
not transfer copyright in that material to the Licensor.

Feedback

By providing Feedback, you grant Artur Czarnecki a perpetual, worldwide,
non-exclusive, royalty-free, and irrevocable license to use, evaluate,
develop, modify, and incorporate ideas, suggestions, and information from
that Feedback into Intergrax and to create products or services based on that
Feedback. Posting Feedback does not transfer copyright in the literal text of
that Feedback. Ordinary Feedback is not automatically a Code Contribution or
Documentation Contribution. This license does not require you to keep Feedback
confidential. Do not submit confidential information or trade secrets as
Feedback.

Patent Rights

The licenses in this Section 8 for Code Contributions and Documentation
Contributions do not grant any patent license except as may be expressly
